      {
        "id": "p16-q15-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$210000\\times0.00613$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$1\\times10^3$",
          "worked": "Round each factor to 1 significant figure.\n$$\\begin{align*}210000\\times0.00613&\\approx200000\\times0.006\\\\210000\\times0.00613&\\approx1200\\\\210000\\times0.00613&\\approx1\\times10^3\\quad\\text{(1 significant figure)}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p16-q15-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$470000000\\div216000$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$2\\times10^3$",
          "worked": "Round each number to 1 significant figure.\n$$\\begin{align*}470000000\\div216000&\\approx500000000\\div200000\\\\470000000\\div216000&\\approx2500\\\\470000000\\div216000&\\approx2\\times10^3\\quad\\text{(1 significant figure)}\\end{align*}$$\nThe intermediate estimate lies on a rounding boundary. The original quotient is less than $2500$, so its 1 significant figure estimate is $2000$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p16-q15-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{0.000473}{0.00991}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$5\\times10^{-2}$",
          "worked": "Round the numerator and denominator to 1 significant figure.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{0.000473}{0.00991}&\\approx\\frac{0.0005}{0.01}\\\\\\frac{0.000473}{0.00991}&\\approx0.05\\\\\\frac{0.000473}{0.00991}&\\approx5\\times10^{-2}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p16-q15-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$(0.00314)^2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$1\\times10^{-5}$",
          "worked": "Round the base to 1 significant figure, then square.\n$$\\begin{align*}(0.00314)^2&\\approx(0.003)^2\\\\(0.00314)^2&\\approx0.000009\\\\(0.00314)^2&\\approx1\\times10^{-5}\\quad\\text{(1 significant figure)}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      }
